I always keep one /fire and one /cold in main inventory, though if
you've genocided eels there's no need for the /cold (and I'd probably
ditch the cold but not fire before the planes anyway).  I ditch the
rest of those 2, and otherwise only carry /wishing /digging /teleport
and /death in quantity to the planes, though 1 /secret door detection,
enlighenment, or poly may come along for fun.

Frost Brand is the 2nd best weapon in the game after Grayswandir, IMO.
Double damage against non-magic-resistant things.

I'd take, in order: Grayswandir, Frost Brand, Fire Brand, Mjollnir,
Excalibur, Stormbringer/Sceptre of Might.   Of course for non-combat
perks others (Magicbane, Sunsword, Staff of Aesculapius) are nice too.
I avoid two-handed weapons, otherwise the Staff, Tsurugi, and Cleaver
would be higher on the list.



